Yes! It's really possible! This procedure should work with every
version of NH,
SE or whatever that has the DEBUG MODE option compiled actived.

(Windows-only steps - shortly, ENTER WIZARD MODE)

1 - Press CTRL-ESC, then choose Run...

2 - Type:

    "<your game path and name>" -u wizard -D

    Ex.: "D:\NetHack\nethackw.exe" -u wizard -D

3 - Press Enter

(General steps, now)

4 - Choose your favorite character, role, etc.

5 - Press CTRL-N to toggle invulnerability for 32000 turns. It may be
useful.

6 - Press CTRL-V (level tel.), type ? <Enter> and choose from the list
"earth"
    (it's on the bottom). Now you should level-teleport to the Earth
Level with
    a beautiful amulet...

  Destination is earth level with the amulet. --more--
